## 1. OBJECTIVE

Super Admin currently cannot post a drive. Implement a **Central Drive** feature so the Super Admin can post institution-wide drives (spanning multiple departments), visible in a new "Campus Drives" master-detail page, matching the attached reference screenshots:

- **Screen A** — Master-detail layout: left column is a scrollable list of drive cards (company, status badge, role, date, min CGPA); right panel shows the full detail of the selected drive (key placement dates, portals/links, venue & logistics, application fields required with toggle switches).
- **Screen B** — The bottom of the detail panel: a list of application fields, each with a toggle switch (on/off), ending in a "Save Configuration" button.
- **Screen C** — Clicking "+ Post Central Drive" opens a modal with: Company Name, Role/Designation, Package/CTC, Min CGPA Cutoff, Drive Date, Application Deadline, Company Portal/Registration URL (optional), Pre-Placement Talk Link (optional), Job Description & Instructions (textarea), Cancel / Create Central Drive buttons.

Do not build a separate design system — reuse the existing components below.

