## 4. AUTHORIZATION

- Add `requireSuperAdmin()` usage (already exists per `lib/auth.ts`, used in FE-08) to every new action/query in this unit.
- A central drive's `departmentId` is always `null` and `isCentralDrive` is always `true` — enforce this server-side in `createCentralDrive`, never trust a client-provided value for either field.
- Reuse the existing `driveSchema` (Zod) from `features/drives/schemas/drive.ts` for shared fields (company, role, package, CGPA, dates, etc.) rather than duplicating validation. Add a thin `createCentralDriveSchema` that omits `departmentId` (since a dept admin's own-department pre-check doesn't apply here) and requires `eligibleDepartments` to contain **at least one** department (super admin picks explicitly, or "all departments" as a convenience option — see §6.3).

