## 8. ELIGIBILITY — DO NOT BREAK THE STUDENT SIDE

`getEligibleDrives()` (student-facing, from FE-03) filters purely on `eligibleDepartments` JSON and the eligibility rules (CGPA, backlogs) — it has no dependency on `departmentId`. Central drives with `departmentId: null` must flow through this exact same function unmodified. After implementing, manually verify: log in as a student in an eligible department with a CGPA above the central drive's cutoff, confirm the central drive appears in their eligible drives list identically to a department-posted drive.

